[TITLE]
E2 (2006 parameterization) - Vasconcelos et al. (2006) rapid pipe-filling experiment.
Acrylic pipe L=14.33 m, D=0.094 m, horizontal. Upstream fill box 0.25x0.25 m (h=0.31 m),
downstream surge tank D=0.19 m (h=1.50 m). Initial uniform depth 0.073 m (78%D), at rest.
Inflow 3.1 L/s admitted at fill box at t=0. Free air venting (vent tower not modeled - 1D water).
Measured: pressure head at x=9.9 m (VJ99) and x=14.1 m (VJ141); velocity at 9.9 m (link C2);
surge-tank level (node ST depth). Paper numerics: 400 cells (dx~0.036 m), Cr=0.95, n=0.012,
a=25 m/s. Stations are VIRTUAL junctions: sealed splices, transparent to the solution -
they double as the VJ-composition check (plan MIXED_FLOW_CLOSURES §2.2(6)).

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           LPS
FLOW_ROUTING         FV
LINK_OFFSETS         DEPTH
START_DATE           01/01/2026
START_TIME           00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2026
END_TIME             00:05:00
REPORT_STEP          0.05
ROUTING_STEP         0.01
MIN_SURFAREA         0.05
SURCHARGE_METHOD     EXTRAN
INERTIAL_DAMPING     NONE
NORMAL_FLOW_LIMITED  NEITHER
FV_CELL_LENGTH       0.036
FV_MIN_CELLS         4
FV_SLOT_CELERITY     25

[STORAGE]
;;Name  Elev  MaxDepth InitDepth Shape      A1/Curve A2  A0      SurDepth Fevap
FB      0.0   0.31     0.073     FUNCTIONAL 0        0   0.0625  0        0
ST      0.0   1.50     0.073     FUNCTIONAL 0        0   0.02835 0        0

[VIRTUAL_JUNCTIONS]
;;Name  Elev
VJ99    0.0
VJ141   0.0

; Rim-overflow path: the surge tank is open-topped (rim at 1.50 m). The weir crest
; sits AT the rim (= ST MaxDepth), so it is transparent to the solution; it exists
; because the engine (legacy ERROR 145 parity) requires >= 1 outfall node.
[OUTFALLS]
;;Name  Elev   Type   StageData  Gated
DN      0.0    FREE              NO

[WEIRS]
;;Name  From  To   Type        CrestHt  Cd    Gated  EC
OVF     ST    DN   TRANSVERSE  1.50     1.84  NO     0

[CONDUITS]
;;Name  From   To     Length  N      Zin  Zout  Q0
C1      FB     VJ99   9.90    0.012  0    0     0
C2      VJ99   VJ141  4.20    0.012  0    0     0
C3      VJ141  ST     0.23    0.012  0    0     0

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link  Shape     Geom1  Geom2 Geom3 Geom4 Barrels
C1      CIRCULAR  0.094  0     0     0     1
C2      CIRCULAR  0.094  0     0     0     1
C3      CIRCULAR  0.094  0     0     0     1
OVF     RECT_OPEN 0.10   0.19  0     0

[INFLOWS]
;;Node  Constituent  Tseries  Type  Mfactor  Sfactor  Baseline
FB      FLOW         ""       FLOW  1.0      1.0      3.1

[REPORT]
CONTINUITY YES
FLOWSTATS YES
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
